Redis 7.2.x (full mode, optional profile)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
License: BSD-3-Clause (Redis license terms prior to the 7.4/8.x relicensing
to RSALv2/SSPLv2). This repository intentionally pins the compose image to
the `redis:7.2.x` line to remain on the permissive BSD-3-Clause terms and
avoid the source-available licensing introduced from Redis 7.4 onward.
Redis is optional in this project: single-instance deployments (including
`docker-compose.lite.yml`) fall back to an in-process implementation
(Caffeine cache + Guava RateLimiter + JVM lock, `cache.provider=local`);
Redis absence never affects functional correctness, only multi-instance
scaling (see requirements doc §5, Redis responsibility boundary).

